# src/platform FRAS Map
src/platform/*-markdown.ts [Infra]: F:Platform-specific outbound markdown renderers and degraders | A:flattenMarkdown,renderDingtalkMarkdown,renderDiscordMarkdown,renderLarkMarkdown,renderSlackMarkdown,renderTelegramMarkdown,renderWebMarkdown | S:Streaming safe and escapes unsupported markdown constructs
src/platform/adapter.ts [Core]: F:PlatformAdapter interface and PlatformCapabilities matrix | A:PlatformAdapter,PlatformCapabilities
src/platform/config-schemas.ts [Infra]: F:Credential schemas for supported chat platforms | A:ChatGateSchema,PLATFORM_SCHEMAS | S:Free of Satori imports so config loading avoids heavy dependency chain
src/platform/markdown-tables.ts [Infra]: F:GFM table degradation to bold row headers and bullet lines | A:renderTableBlock,splitTableRow
src/platform/platform-factory.ts [Core]: F:Platform adapter dispatch and instantiation | R:src/platform/adapter.ts,src/platform/satori-core.ts | A:createPlatformAdapter
src/platform/profile-helpers.ts [Infra]: F:Common normalization helpers for platform profiles | A:findAtMention,installHttpService,plainConversation
src/platform/profile.ts [Core]: F:PlatformProfile seam interface specification | A:PlatformProfile
src/platform/profiles/*.ts [Edge]: F:Concrete platform profiles for Discord, Telegram, Slack, Lark, QQ, LINE, WeCom, and DingTalk
src/platform/satori-core.ts [Core]: F:Generic Satori adapter lifecycle and message normalization | R:src/platform/profile.ts | A:createSatoriAdapter | S:Generic bot methods called directly, only platform differences go through profile
src/platform/satori-file-url.ts [Infra]: F:Upstream file URL resolution fix for Satori | A:installRelativeFileUrlFix
src/platform/telegram-start-retry.ts [Infra]: F:Retry logic for transient Telegram bot startup failures | A:describeTelegramStartError,isTransientTelegramStartError | S:Retries transient 5xx/429/network startup failures with exponential backoff while failing fast on 4xx [T:isTransientTelegramStartError]
src/platform/webui/*.ts [Edge]: F:Built-in browser UI implementation of PlatformAdapter | A:createWebuiAdapter | S:See Security invariants item 7
src/platform/webui/doctor.ts [Edge]: F:Web UI doctor diagnostics (port, owner allowFrom, plain HTTP, SSO JWKS, plugins) | A:checkWebui,inspectWebuiPlugins | S:See Security invariants item 12
src/platform/webui/plugins/*.ts [Edge]: F:Server-side Web UI plugin manifest validation, safe directory checks, static asset allowlist loader, and PluginHost runtime | A:PluginManifestSchema,parsePluginManifest,assertSafePluginDir,loadSinglePlugin,loadPlugins,pluginMimeType,PluginHostManager,normalizePluginRoutePath | S:Rejects files.roots and agent workdirs via realpath containment; serves only manifest-whitelisted files under GUARDED /plugins/<id>/<file>; namespaces plugin API routes under GUARDED /api/plugins/<id>/, enforces visible [plugin:<id>] attribution on topic sends, and isolates storage to 0600 atomic <configDir>/plugins/<id>.json
src/platform/webui/client/* [Edge]: F:Web UI client entrypoint (main.ts, build-markers.d.ts), base primitives (base/lifecycle.ts, base/event.ts, base/html.ts, base/dom.ts), core services (services/boot.ts, services/storage.ts, services/store.ts, services/commands.ts, services/keybindings.ts, services/overlays.ts, services/api.ts, services/stream.ts, services/cache.ts, services/reads.ts), reusable UI components (components/{list,filterbar,actionbar,tabs,menu,dialog,sheet,quickpick,form,tree,badge,notice,splitter}/index.ts), default workbench contracts, shell, dynamic/static dock engine, gridview, group, dnd, serialize, layout commands, splitview, parts, mobile drawer controller, and mobile bottom tab bar (workbench/contracts.ts, workbench/shell.ts, workbench/mobile-drawer.ts, workbench/mobile-tabbar.ts, workbench/dock/{splitview,gridview,group,dnd,serialize,engine,layout-commands,static}.ts, workbench/parts/{activity-bar,sidebar-part,secondary-part,panel-part,status-bar}.ts), plugin contracts and runtime (plugins/api.ts, plugins/registry.ts, plugins/host.ts, plugins/builtin.ts, plugins/lazy-extras.ts), 12 built-in feature plugins and controllers (features/topics/{plugin,index,age,tree,row-render,filter-bar,row-menu,row-sheet,gestures,prefetch,idle-dialog,types}.ts, features/topic/{plugin,editor/{index,dom,header,panel,types},status/{index,format,pending-queue,model-pop,types},transcript/{index,types,scroll,code-blocks,btw,markup,banners,events},composer/{index,attachments,image-shrink,drafts,voice,slash-hints,clipboard,unsent,types}}.ts, features/history/{plugin,index,view,editor,helpers}.ts, features/schedules/{plugin,index,store,view,editor,helpers,types}.ts, features/reviews/{plugin,index,store,view,editor,types}.ts, features/skills/{plugin,index,store,view,editor,filtering,new-dialog,types}.ts, features/settings/{plugin,index,controller,render,types,workbench-catalog,workbench-editor,workbench-instructions,workbench-types}.ts, features/changes/{plugin,index,changes-tool,diff-editor,diff-view,diff-helpers,types}.ts, features/files/{plugin,index,files-tool,file-editor,helpers,types}.ts, features/terminal/{plugin,index}.ts, features/reader/{plugin,index}.ts, features/status/{plugin,index,device-settings,i18n,icons,idle-dialog,notify-bridge,topics-stats,types}.ts, features/notify/index.ts), theme controller/boot (theme.ts, theme-boot.ts), zero-dependency i18n module (i18n/index.ts, en.ts, zh-CN.ts), and modular stylesheets (styles/main.css importing VS Code Dark/Light Modern styles/tokens.css + 18 feature/layout/workbench/components CSS modules + styles/workbench-theme.css) bundled into dist/webui-assets and linked by page.ts | R:src/platform/webui/icons.ts,src/platform/webui/cache-script.ts,src/platform/webui/protocol.ts | A:DisposableStore,MutableDisposable,Emitter,html,render,escapeHtml,readBootConfig,StorageService,Store,CommandRegistry,KeybindingService,OverlayManager,createApiClient,post,text,wait,sendLimit,createStreamClient,applyTopicRows,createCacheService,collectCacheableMessages,createReadsService,createList,createFilterBar,createActionBar,createTabs,createSegmented,createMenu,openDialog,openConfirmDialog,openBottomSheet,openQuickPick,createTree,renderBadge,renderTag,renderStatusDot,createNotice,createEmptyState,createSplitter,clampSize,layoutSplitSizes,resizeSplitAt,SplitView,StaticDockEngine,ActivityBarPart,SidebarPart,SecondaryPart,PanelPart,StatusBarPart,MobileTabBar,createMobileMorePanel,WorkbenchShell,resolveShellMode,mountWorkbench,createSettingsFeature,renderSettingsScreen,inlineCodeHtml,agHue,createTopicsFeature,makeFilterBar,createTopicStatusController,stClock,stLeft,createTranscriptController,createComposerController,framed,copyText,createNotifyController,createTerminalController,createCodeViewLoader,createLightbox,createReader,formatByteSize,definePlugin,ContributionRegistry,WebuiEventBus,PluginI18nRegistry,createPluginContext,PluginManager,BUILTIN_PLUGIN_IDS,createBuiltinPlugins,createDefaultBuiltinPluginFactories,registerBuiltinPlugins,t,getLocale,setLocale,initLocale,onLocaleChange,applyDomI18n,SUPPORTED_LOCALES,getTheme,setTheme,resolveTheme,initTheme | S:No inline script (CSP script-src 'self'); server decisions arrive as boot-config JSON; entire client/ tree (including main.ts) checked by client/tsconfig.json and eslint; default VS Code-style workbench shell with VS Code Dark/Light Modern theme and 12 built-in plugins
